                "spaceBefore": 0,
                "spaceAfter": 2,
                "lineHeight": 1.4,
                "indent": 0,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Apply Pythagoras: ",
                    "marks": []
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "math",
                    "latex": "AB^2+BC^2=AC^2",
                    "display": false
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": ". Substitute ",
                    "marks": []
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "math",
                    "latex": "AB=1",
                    "display": false
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": " and the results of parts (a) and (b).",
                    "marks": []
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          "worked": "By Pythagoras, substituting $AB=1$ and the results of parts (a) and (b),\n$$\\begin{align*}AB^2+BC^2 &= AC^2\\\\1^2+(\\tan\\theta)^2 &= (\\sec\\theta)^2\\\\1+\\tan^2\\theta &= \\sec^2\\theta.\\end{align*}$$",
